  ("Non-biodegradable waste stays for long, harms animals and may enter food chains.","non-biodegradable"),
  ("Waste management: reduce, reuse and recycle. Segregate wet and dry waste at home.","reduce, reuse, recycle"),
  ("Composting makes manure from biodegradable waste. Landfills and incineration have problems of their own.","composting"),
  ("Use cloth bags, avoid single-use plastic and dispose of waste properly.","single-use plastic"),
