 ("Classify: banana peel, plastic bottle, paper, glass.",[("Banana peel and paper are biodegradable.","Decomposed by microbes."),("Plastic bottle and glass are non-biodegradable.","Not broken down easily."),("Recycle the plastic and glass; compost the peel.","Disposal.")]),
